   "txt": "**1. Single Most Important Fact**  \nThe Board of Directors approved the appointment of Mr. Chockalingam Narayanan (currently Head \u2013 Equities Alternates) as Senior Management Personnel (SMP) under the Alternates division (primarily for investments in equity securities), effective November 13, 2026.\n\n**2. Key Numbers**  \n* None stated in this document (routine management appointment filing under Regulation 30).\n\n**3. Management Guidance or Forward Outlook**  \n* No forward-looking statements or financial guidance are provided.\n\n**4. What a Shareholder Should Watch or Act On**  \n* **No action required.** Shareholders should note that Mr. Narayanan has been with the AMC since July 2022 managing PMS and AIF equity portfolios; this filing designates him as key Senior Management Personnel.\n\n**5. One-Line Net Read**  \n* **Neutral**: Routine internal designation/elevation of an existing senior fund manager to designated Senior Management Personnel status, having no direct short-term financial impact."
